WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.695
The last Shuttle from this pad.

00:02.375 --> 00:05.516
Pad 39B saw 53 Space Shuttle launches.

00:05.989 --> 00:12.519
The last, STS-116, left in the dark with a crew of seven for the International Space Station.

00:13.147 --> 00:15.317
Discovery was the Shuttle on the pad.
